+ * payload itself. Returns false only on a real descriptor error
+ * (matching `esp_gdma_read_channel`'s error status reporting);
+ * encountering a not-yet-owned-by-DMA descriptor (nothing new queued
+ * this tick) or reaching `max_descriptors` is not an error.
